msgid ""
"Allow the staff member to uninstall extensions, including their associated "
"database records and files."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga kengaytmalarni, jumladan, ular bilan bog'liq ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"yozuvlari va fayllarini o'chirishga ruxsat bering."

