msgid "Allows the staff member to add new currencies to the system."
msgstr "Xodimga tizimga yangi valyutalarni qo'shish imkonini beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to add or remove balance entries for client accounts."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga mijoz hisoblari uchun balans yozuvlarini qo'shish yoki o'chirish "
"imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to authenticate as any client account."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga har qanday mijoz hisobi sifatida autentifikatsiya qilish imkonini "
"beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to change the system default currency."
msgstr "Xodimga tizimning standart valyutasini o'zgartirishga ruxsat beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to clear cached update information and fetch the "
"latest update metadata."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga keshlangan yangilanish ma'lumotlarini tozalash va so'nggi "
"yangilanish metama'lumotlarini olish imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to create and edit :type: accounts."
msgstr "Xodimga:type: hisoblarini yaratish va tahrirlash imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to create and edit redirects."
msgstr "Xodimga yo'naltirishlarni yaratish va tahrirlash imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to create new client accounts."
msgstr "Xodimga yangi mijoz hisoblarini yaratishga ruxsat beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to create, update, and delete client groups."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga mijozlar guruhlarini yaratish, yangilash va o'chirish imkonini "
"beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to create, update, delete, reset, and regenerate "
"email templates."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga elektron pochta shablonlarini yaratish, yangilash, o'chirish, qayta "
"o'rnatish va qayta tiklash imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to delete :type: accounts."
msgstr "Xodimga:type: hisoblarini o'chirishga ruxsat beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to delete redirects."
msgstr "Xodimga yo'naltirishni o'chirishga ruxsat beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to delete sent email log entries."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga yuborilgan elektron pochta jurnali yozuvlarini o'chirishga ruxsat "
"beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to edit settings for this module."
msgstr "Xodimga ushbu modul sozlamalarini tahrirlash imkonini beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to enable or disable error reporting for this "
"FOSSBilling instance."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga ushbu FOSSBilling misoli uchun xato hisobotini yoqish yoki o'chirish "
"imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to export client account data."
msgstr "Xodimga mijoz hisobi ma'lumotlarini eksport qilish imkonini beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to fetch a list of all local interface IP addresses "
"and set the default network interface for ClientFence to use."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga barcha mahalliy interfeys IP manzillari ro'yxatini olish va "
"ClientFence uchun standart tarmoq interfeysini o'rnatish imkonini beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to fetch a list of all local interface IP addresses "
"and set the default network interface for FOSSBilling to use."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga barcha mahalliy interfeys IP manzillari ro'yxatini olish va "
"FOSSBilling uchun standart tarmoq interfeysini o'rnatish imkonini beradi."

