msgstr ""
"Xodimga navbatdagi elektron pochta xabarlarini yuborish, qayta yuborish va "
"qayta ishlash imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to set new passwords for client accounts."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga mijoz hisoblari uchun yangi parollar o'rnatishga ruxsat beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to update ClientFence."
msgstr "Xodimga ClientFenceni yangilash imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to update FOSSBilling."
msgstr "Xodimga FOSSBillingni yangilash imkonini beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to update client profile details and account "
