msgstr ""
"Xodimga tizim parametrlarini tizim API so'nggi nuqtasi orqali yangilash "
"imkonini beradi."

msgid ""
"Allows the staff member to view and generate API keys for client accounts."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga mijoz hisoblari uchun API kalitlarini ko'rish va yaratish imkonini "
"beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to view client account details and listings."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga mijoz hisobi ma'lumotlari va ro'yxatlarini ko'rish imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to view client login history and IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga mijozning kirish tarixi va IP manzillarini ko'rish imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to view email templates and template details."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga elektron pochta shablonlari va shablon tafsilotlarini ko'rish "
"imkonini beradi."

msgid "Allows the staff member to view sent emails and queued email messages."
msgstr ""
"Xodimga yuborilgan elektron pochta xabarlari va navbatdagi elektron pochta "
"xabarlarini ko'rish imkonini beradi."

