msgid ""
"If the text is very long you can use <strong>&lt;!--more--&gt;</strong> tag. "
"Inserting this tag within the post will create and excerpt of text (before "
"the tag) to be displayed in posts list. Users will be able to see whole "
"content when they click on \"Read more\" button."
msgstr ""
"Agar matn juda uzun bo'lsa, <strong> &lt;!--batafsil--&gt; </strong> tegi. "
"Ushbu tegni post ichiga kiritish postlar ro'yxatida ko'rsatiladigan matndan "
"(tegdan oldin) parcha hosil qiladi va ko'rsatadi. Foydalanuvchilar “Batafsil "
"o'qish” tugmasini bosganlarida butun tarkibni ko'rishlari mumkin bo'ladi."

msgid ""
"If there is a need to change the way notification looks or is being "
"displayed, you can do it by editing"
msgstr ""
"Agar bildirishnomaning ko'rinishini yoki ko'rsatilishini o'zgartirish "
"zarurati tug'ilsa, uni tahrirlash orqali qilishingiz mumkin"

msgid ""
"If you are happy with the selected payment gateway, please use the button "
"below to continue with it."
msgstr ""
"Agar tanlangan to'lov shlyuzidan mamnun bo'lsangiz, uni davom ettirish uchun "
"quyidagi tugmani bosing."

msgid ""
"If you are happy with the selected payment gateway, please use the button "
"below to continue with it. Optionally, you may choose a different payment "
"gateway if you wish to pay using a subscription."
msgstr ""
"Agar tanlangan to'lov shlyuzidan mamnun bo'lsangiz, uni davom ettirish uchun "
"quyidagi tugmani bosing. Majburiy emas, agar siz obuna orqali to'lashni "
"xohlasangiz, boshqa to'lov shlyuzini tanlashingiz mumkin."

