"If you are sure that this transaction is valid you can update transaction "
"details in &quot;Manage&quot; tab and try processing transaction again"
msgstr ""
"Agar ushbu tranzaksiya haqiqiy ekanligiga ishonchingiz komil bo'lsa, &quot;"
"Boshqarish&quot; yorlig'iga o'ting va tranzaksiyani qayta ishlashga urinib "
"ko'ring"

msgid ""
"If you cannot find the extensions you are looking for in the admin area, "
"please visit the extension directory at <a href=\"https://extensions."
"fossbilling.org\" target=\"_blank\">https://extensions.fossbilling.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"Agar administrator hududida siz izlayotgan kengaytmalarni topa olmasangiz, "
"<a href=\"https://extensions.fossbilling.org\" target=\"_blank\"> https://"
"extensions.fossbilling.org </a> manzilidagi kengaytmalar katalogiga tashrif "
"buyuring."

msgid ""
"If you would like to hide domain contact information which is shown on WHOIS "
"you can enable privacy protection. Once domain privacy protection is enabled "
"no one will know who registered this service. And once you decide to disable "
"privacy protection, information that is listed above on \"Update Domain "
"Contact Details\" section will be seen on domain WHOIS again."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz WHOIS-da ko'rsatilgan domen bilan bog'lanish ma'lumotlarini "
"yashirishni istasangiz, maxfiylik himoyasini yoqishingiz mumkin. Domen "
"maxfiyligi himoyasi yoqilgandan so'ng, bu xizmatni kim ro'yxatdan "
"o'tkazganini hech kim bilmaydi. Maxfiylik himoyasini o'chirishga qaror "
"qilganingizdan so'ng, yuqorida \"Domen bilan bog'lanish ma'lumotlarini "
"yangilash\" bo'limida keltirilgan ma'lumotlar WHOIS domenida yana ko'rinadi."

msgid ""
"If you would like to host this domain with another company you can update "
